---
config:
  theme: dark
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Service
    participant Primary
    participant Replica
    critical Write the record
        Service->>Primary: Insert
    option Primary is down
        Service->>Replica: Insert into the replica
    option Both are down
        Service->>Service: Queue for later
    end
    critical Without options
        Service->>Primary: Commit
    end
    Note over Service,Replica: Dark theme note
